  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_6d1ee7ae-0ec9-48af-97fb-5ceccb90ef57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"323\" height=\"323\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminestrator.com%252fa%252fCREATEFRANCE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_00b06b57-5783-4c54-a00c-c012ec97c019.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SykPYgYkKk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/647559221855911938?style=flat-square&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&labelColor=#1fcf5a&color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"161\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.20.1-Create_France?style=flat-square&logo=CURSEFORGE&label=Create France&labelColor=#1fcf5a&color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"25\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/En Ligne-Server?style=flat-square&logo=Minetest&label=Serveur&labelColor=#1fcf5a&color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"25\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>当前版本</strong>：1.1.1<br>修复了 1.1.2 桥梁结构的 FPS 问题，并添加了桥梁说明以帮助理解其工作原理<br><strong>兼容性</strong>：Minecraft 1.20.1 &amp; 1.21.1 Neoforge，需搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 5 和 Create 6</a><br>1.1.2<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_253e8444-3c0c-46f9-9567-20d0b85ee4e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"521\"><br>1.0.8<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_cf97e8e6-dd06-47dc-bba2-f235a43ce4ca.png\"></p>\n<p>1.0.5</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_9a9b143e-66a0-4f4a-ac49-55aee81e41ec.png\"></p>\n<p>1.0.4</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_0efb8457-ef0e-4f5e-bca9-3c9d0d44e938.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"303\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_72d5e724-4e88-4ce7-9367-3a6869e740d6.png\" width=\"486\" height=\"308\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_eb7cfdea-6204-4b8b-90d8-d48f169d33e2.png\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>关于模组</h2>\n<p>欢迎来到 <strong>Create Furnitures</strong>，这是一款通过添加工业风格家具来丰富你 Minecraft 体验的模组！如果你是 <strong>Create</strong> 模组的粉丝，它将为你带来各种材质和颜色的桌子、椅子和凳子，完美契合你的建筑作品。非常适合装饰工作室、餐厅或温馨的蒸汽朋克角落！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<h2>主要特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>桌子</strong>：提供 4 种变体，基于 Create 模组的标志性材质：<br><br>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>安山岩外壳</strong></li>\n<li><strong>铜外壳</strong></li>\n<li><strong>铁轨外壳</strong></li>\n<li><strong>黄铜外壳</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>椅子</strong>：每把椅子都匹配桌子的材质，外观和谐统一。你可以坐在上面，获得极致的沉浸感！</li>\n<li><strong>凳子</strong>：小巧实用，非常适合温馨角落或工业工作室。</li>\n<li><strong>颜色</strong>：每种家具均提供 4 种不同配色，让你拥有更多自定义选择。<br><br><br></li>\n<li><strong>柱子</strong>：新增柱子</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>小型安山岩柱</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>小型黄铜柱</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>大型安山岩柱</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>游戏截图</h2>\n<p><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_2baae0a8-fe7a-426d-9e02-308d3f103323.png\"></em></p>\n<p><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_129a7a38-69f4-401e-962b-c75f89bbd783.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></em></p>\n<h2>如何合成家具？</h2>\n<p>合成这些家具非常简单直观！将 Create 模组的外壳放入切石机中即可。</p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>与 Create 的集成</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该家具使用 Create 模组的材质，确保完美的视觉融合。</li>\n<li>兼容 Create 的高级机械，例如 <strong>装配线</strong>。</li>\n<li>为你的机械系统和工业基地增添装饰性细节！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>安装指南</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>确保已安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 模组。</li>\n<li>在此页面下载 <strong>Create Furnitures</strong> 文件。</li>\n<li>将该 .jar 文件放入你 Minecraft 安装目录下的 <strong>mods</strong> 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>启动游戏，享受你的新家具吧！</li>\n</ol>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>兼容性与问题反馈</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>兼容性</strong>：适用于所有与 <strong>Create</strong> 兼容的版本。</li>\n<li><strong>已知问题</strong>：目前暂无。如果你发现任何 Bug，请在“Issues”板块中反馈。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>作者</strong>：<em>Arginou</em></li>\n<li><strong>素材与灵感来源</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 模组</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>相关链接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>我的社区服务器整合包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/serveur-create-france-communauty-friends-coop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create France Serveur</a></li>\n<li>我的 Discord 频道：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/ScMHdge2uv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt;&gt;链接&lt;&lt;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>感谢下载 Create Furnitures！</h3>\n<p>如果你喜欢这个模组，别忘了留下评论和评分！这将有助于提高模组的知名度并促进持续优化。</p>",
